		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row2"><span class="name"><a name="58972"></a><b>Conqueso</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Bear Officer<br /><img src="images/avatars/4288d51a40815007555da.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 29 Apr 2003<br />Posts: 3844<br />Location: Texas</span><br /></td>
		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=58972&amp;sid=3e61e3c78249dfa08a8b03f2c8615ce8#58972"><img src="templates/subSilver/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue May 25, 2004 1:31 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=58972&amp;sid=3e61e3c78249dfa08a8b03f2c8615ce8"><img src="templates/subSilver/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">You dont put a contract on multiple houses when you are shopping for a house unless you want to lose some money. You look at the house, the area, etc and, when you decide on the house you like, then you put a contract on it. 
<br />

<br />
People applying to MoKB get to know our members first, find someone wanting to act as a sponsor, and are even welcomed to join us on a few raids before they apply. Some apply immediately with a sponsor since they know exactly what they want. We want people that are committed and have made their decisions. Like I said earlier, our recruit process is long and we want people that have fully made up their mind.</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
