	<tr>
		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="58974"></a><b>Zelandakh</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Bear<br /><img src="images/avatars/d92b63ef3e15c79700679.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Joined: 03 Jan 2003<br />Posts: 756<br />Location: England</span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=58974&amp;sid=3e61e3c78249dfa08a8b03f2c8615ce8#58974"><img src="templates/subSilver/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue May 25, 2004 1:49 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=58974&amp;sid=3e61e3c78249dfa08a8b03f2c8615ce8"><img src="templates/subSilver/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">It's quite ok to ask questions of multiple guilds, and to get to know members from more than 1 guild. However when it comes to actually applying it's usual to only make 1 application at a time. This is fairly standard throughout EQ on all servers.
<br />

<br />
In this case I feel I should also point out that MoKB and Omen are quite different as guilds, so I would strongly recommend you ask around about the reputations of these 2 guilds as to exactly what you are looking for. Omen are much more 'hardcore' than us, and have a more 'direct' approach to certain situations. If this is what you are looking for then I would suggest Omen, CoS and SotN, or at a lower level CB. If you are looking for more of a balance between raiding and a more relaxed or social atmosphere then MoKB and IV (et al) would be more approriate.
<br />

<br />
I hope this is useful to you in deciding which (single) guild you feel you should approach.
<br />

<br />
(-:   Zel   :-)<br />_________________<br />A song is worth a thousand pictures.</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
